  "tagline": "A board hand-off with OpenPnP: SMEMA, the board code and a trace, behind the shared gate.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-OPENPNP coordinates the hand-off of printed circuit boards between a robot cell and an OpenPnP pick-and-place machine. It trusts the state file written by OpenPnP's own event scripts only while it is fresh, checks the DataMatrix of the board, speaks SMEMA to the neighbours on the line, passes every job through the shared evaluate_job gate and records the story of each board for the data lake.",
